, which is faster and comes with all upgrades unlocked immediately for a fun sandbox fighting in the orbital war of the new ringed planets orbit. \r\n\r\nNew friendly units - Larger cruisers, capitals and friendly fighters have been added to aid the player in this new mission! \r\n\r\nNew QoL updates - added graphics section to options and fixed some FPS drops due to bloom/shadows on certain levels. Other minor menu tweaks and bug fixes", "created_date": 1794944242, "id": "1395295213678037", "version": "0.1.2", "version_code": 20, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}